Baha Plus TV

The official-site adapters and search conversion data are derived from Baha-Plus
(InternetBugs, reference checkout 0780ccd, inspected 2026-11-12).
The upstream MIT copyright and license are preserved in LICENSE and packaged as
app/src/main/assets/LICENSE.

TV-specific changes include keeping the official controls accessible before the
native video handoff, native navigation, bounded image loading, TV search and
favorite commands, and remote cursor navigation.

